      "content": "You should highlight how excessive compliance costs drastically increase the time-to-market for small fintech startups, effectively eliminating their agility with larger established players. Your pitch needs to emphasize that these burdens force small innovators to divest heavily into legal and reporting teams rather than focusing on core product development or customer value. Ultimately, arguing that his situation creates an unfair playing field can persuade investors to seek regulatory changes or provide support to ensure new ventures can survive and thrive.",
